#~ msgid "Operation using Annotation"
#~ msgstr "使用标注的操作"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "DingoDB presents a Java API which is comprehensive and powerful, but "
#~ "requires a measure of boiler plate code to map the data from Java POJOs "
#~ "to the database. The Annotation is aim to lower the amount of code "
#~ "required when mapping POJOs to DingoDB and back as well as reducing some "
#~ "of the brittleness of the code."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "DingoDB提供的Java应用程序接口（API）全面而强大，但需要大量的模板代码才能将"
#~ "数据从Java POJOs映射到数据库。注释的目的是减少将 POJOs 映射到 DingoDB 时所"
#~ "需的代码量，同时减少代码的脆弱性。"

#~ msgid "Keys"
#~ msgstr "键"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The key to an DingoDB record can be specified either as a field or a "
#~ "property. Remember that DingoDB keys can be Strings, numberical types and "
#~ "date types only."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "DingoDB 记录的键可以指定为字段或属性。请注意：DingoDB 的键只能是字符串、数"
#~ "字类型和日期类型。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "To use a field as the key, simply mark the field with the DingoKey "
#~ "annotation:"
#~ msgstr "要使用某个字段作为键，只需用 DingoKey 注释标记该字段即可。"

#~ msgid "Column"
#~ msgstr "列"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Fields in Java can be mapped to the database irrespective of the "
#~ "visibility of the column. To do so, simply specify the column to map to "
#~ "with the @DingoColumn annotation:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "无论列的可见性如何，Java 中的字段都可以映射到数据库。只需使用 "
#~ "@DingoColumn 注解指定要映射的列即可："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This will map the contents of the `version` field to a `vrsn` column in "
#~ "DingoDB."
#~ msgstr "这将把 `version` 字段的内容映射到 DingoDB 中的 `vrsn` 列。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If the name of the column matches the name of the field in Java, the name "
#~ "can be omitted:"
#~ msgstr "如果列名与 Java 中的字段名一致，则可以省略列名："

#~ msgid "This will appear in DingoDB as the `age` column."
#~ msgstr "这将在 DingoDB 中显示为 `age` 列。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "By default, all fields will be mapped to the database. Fields can be "
#~ "excluded with the @DingoExclude annotation, and renamed with the "
#~ "@DingoColumn annotation. For example:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "默认情况下，所有字段都将映射到数据库。可以使用 @DingoExclude 注解排除字"
#~ "段，并使用 @DingoColumn 注解重命名字段。例如："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This saves the record with 4 columns, `a`,`b`,`c`,`d`. To save only "
#~ "fields `a`,`b`,`c` you can do either:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这样保存的记录有 4 列：`a`,`b`,`c`,`d`。要只保存`a`,`b`,`c`字段，可以选择"
#~ "以下两种方法："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If a field is marked with both @DingoExclude, the column will not be "
#~ "mapped to the database."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果一个字段同时标记了 @DingoExclude 和 @DingoExclude，该列将不会被映射到"
#~ "数据库。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You can force the name of a particular column or columns by specifying "
#~ "them in an DingoColumn:"
#~ msgstr "您可以在 DingoColumn 中指定一列或多列的名称："

#~ msgid "This will save 4 fields in the database, `a`, `b`, `longCname`, `d`."
#~ msgstr "这将在数据库中保存 4 个字段，即 `a`、`b`、`longCname` 和 `d`。"
